{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Bring out.</b> הוֹצֵא is written, הַיְצֵא is read. הַיְצֵא — say to them that they should go out; הוֹצֵא — if they do not want to go out, you bring them out." "<b>And swarm on the earth.</b> And not in the ark — this teaches that even the animals and birds were forbidden sexual relations."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:00.928651175Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}